      "principle": "The burden lies on the accused to prove that the confession was not voluntary.",
      "held": "It is well settled that the burden lies on the accused to prove that the confession was not voluntary. The prosecution has discharged its duty by showing that the confession was made after the accused had been taken into custody and that he had been subjected to third-degree methods of interrogation.",
